tests/diagnostics/front/annotation_precedence.n:3:13: error N00B-P0035: `+` followed by `:` is not allowed, because this could be read more than one way
  help: add parentheses to say which one you mean:
    3 | let sum = (a + b): int
    3 | let sum = a + (b: int)
tests/diagnostics/front/annotation_precedence.n:4:17: error N00B-P0035: `*` followed by `:` is not allowed, because this could be read more than one way
  help: add parentheses to say which one you mean:
    4 | let product = (a * -b): int
    4 | let product = a * -(b: int)
tests/diagnostics/front/annotation_precedence.n:5:16: error N00B-P0036: `cast` followed by `:` is not allowed, because this could be read more than one way
  help: add parentheses to say which one you mean:
    5 | let narrowed = (cast[u8] a): int
    5 | let narrowed = cast[u8] (a: int)
